Call `wait_for_opportunity` first. If it returns `state: waiting`, call `wait_for_opportunity` again. If it returns `state: ready`, read the returned prompt, current opportunity, allowed legal tools, case view, limits, remaining time, attempts remaining, and opportunity id. Complete exactly that opportunity.

Use `case_status`, `get_case`, `list_case_files`, `read_case_text_file`, `request_case_file`, and `read_case_file_bytes` when the facts matter. Scan the case files and docket before each filing. Analyze what each relevant file proves, what it does not prove, and whether provenance, custody, conflict, missing context, or missing links affect weight.

